    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W11 Filing clock\nEvery segment in corridor_class with a plan_due date gets one row in corridor_deadlines (kind cer_class_plan) with the days left before the CER class plan is due. Status: unverified if data_status is not \"verified\" or plan_due is not a valid date, overdue if past, due_soon at 60 days or less, otherwise open. Days are counted in America/Vancouver. Rows without a plan_due are skipped; a row stays in corridor_deadlines if its plan_due is later cleared. No AI, no email yet.\n\n**Trigger:** daily 07:00, or run by hand\n**Reads:** corridor_class\n**Writes:** corridor_deadlines\n**Next:** corridor_deadlines is read by **v2 · API - Dashboard feed**\n\nPart of the v2 set. Hackathon originals are untouched.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 5
      },
